Subject: [PATCH 2/2] README: correct the Toffoli constant and the rotation
 count

The fit 51 F^2 + 196 F + 38 + 4 log2 N is exact in all 39 verified cases
(the constant 66 held only at N = 128 without the log term), and the
circuit has 5F + 3 controlled rotations, not about 6F.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Xs9JbjZtypyAPcQb6NfozE
